ype":4}]}]},"keywords":{"keywords":[{"id":818,"name":"based on novel or book"},{"id":12565,"name":"psychological thriller"},{"id":155251,"name":"novelist"},{"id":180724,"name":"hidden truth"},{"id":207767,"name":"erotic thriller"},{"id":210726,"name":"ghost writer"}]},"external_ids":{"imdb_id":"tt32261958","wikidata_id":"Q131523413","facebook_id":"verityfilm","instagram_id":"verityfilm","twitter_id":null},"watch/providers":{"results":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1283515-verity/watch?locale=US","rent":[{"logo_path":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png","provider_id":10,"provider_name":"Amazon Video","display_priority":9},{"logo_path":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png","provider_id":2,"provider_name":"Apple TV Store","display_priority":10},{"logo_path":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png","provider_id":7,"provider_name":"Fandango At Home","display_priority":40}],"buy":[{"logo_path":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png","provider_id":10,"provider_name":"Amazon Video","display_priority":9},{"logo_path":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png","provider_id":2,"provider_name":"Apple TV Store","display_priority":10},{"logo_path":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png","provider_id":7,"provider_name":"Fandango At Home","display_priority":40}]}}},"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"CZ","title":"Pravda, nebo lež","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"AR","title":"Verity: La sombra de un engaño","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"TH","title":"เงื่อนวิปลาส","type":"Thai"},{"iso_3166_1":"KR","title":"베러티","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"UA","title":"Верітi","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"IL","title":"תעתוע","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"TR","title":"Verity: Gerçeğin Diğer Kıyısı","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"CN","title":"不存在的罪人","type":""}]},"reviews":{"page":1,"results":[{"author":"Manuel São Bento","author_details":{"name":"Manuel São Bento","username":"msbreviews","avatar_path":null,"rating":5},"content":"Check out my full review @ https://www.manuelsbento.com/verity-2026-a-stellar-trio-cant-rescue-a-formulaic-thriller/\r\n\r\nRating: C\r\n\r\nVERITY has a trio of terrific performances, with Anne Hathaway operating a league above everyone else, but it never gives them a thriller worth their talent. The commitment to melodrama is admirable, yet the twists are so familiar that I felt like I was rewatching any other Colleen Hoover adaptation. The tension never really arrives, the trashy/sexy elements are lackluster, and scenes stall for padding before ending exactly where they were headed. Muted, predictable, and struggling to justify its runtime for what it delivers, this one didn't convince me.","created_at":"2026-10-03T09:18:50Z","id":"6ac0c87a470fe4c3b8fda8ca","updated_at":"2026-10-03T09:18:55Z","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/review/6ac0c87a470fe4c3b8fda8ca"},{"author":"Brent Marchant","author_details":{"name":"Brent Marchant","username":"Brent_Marchant","avatar_path":null,"rating":3},"content":"A movie that bills itself as more than it turns out to be has got to be guilty of one of the most egregious sins in filmmaking, and director Michael Showalter’s screen adaptation of this best-selling novel by author Colleen Hoover qualifies on virtually all fronts. Although touted as a dark, erotic psychological thriller, this offering is none of those things. In fact, it barely passes as fare that one might find on the Lifetime cable TV network. When famed novelist Verity Crawford (Anne Hathaway) is severely injured in a car accident, her publisher (K.K. Moggie) looks to hire a ghostwriter to stand in for her to finish several titles in her current book series while (or if) she recovers. Crawford’s husband, Jeremy (Josh Hartnett), recommends the job go to a struggling, little-known aspiring writer, Lowen Ashleigh (Dakota Johnson), whom he inexplicably believes is best capable of mimicking his wife’s prosaic style. Although somewhat intimidated at the prospect of this offer, Lowen nevertheless accepts it and relocates from New York to the Crawfords’ Vermont home, where she has access to the novelist’s extensive notes and research materials. But, once there, the clueless stand-in finds herself embroiled in a scenario full of mysteries, confessions and intrigue involving the Crawfords’ personal and professional lives. What’s more, she unwittingly becomes involved in matters of infidelity (lukewarm though it may be), solving the conundrum of Verity’s true health status, and getting to the bottom of the allegedly accidental drowning of her young daughter (Sienna Kulovitz), a my","created_at":"2026-10-04T02:00:20Z","id":"6ac1b33478d6aa700d2e695e","updated_at":"2026-10-04T02:00:20Z","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/review/6ac1b33478d6aa700d2e695e"},{"author":"Harish Napa Janakiraman","author_details":{"name":"Harish Napa Janakiraman","username":"harishnj22@gmail.com","avatar_path":null,"rating":7},"content":"The psychological thriller sets up an intriguing, twisted premise filled with dark secrets and moral ambiguity. Unraveling the hidden manuscript inside an unsettling household provides genuine suspense, giving the story enough eerie tension to make it a good, engaging watch overall.\r\n\r\nDakota Johnson is absolutely stunning in the lead, bringing effortless allure, quiet curiosity, and sharp emotional vulnerability to her character. Her commanding screen presence anchors the entire film, making her descent into obsession feel captivating even when the narrative begins to drag.\r\n\r\nHowever, the dull screenplay keeps the movie from reaching its full potential. The pacing feels sluggish in key stretches, relying on convenient exposition rather than building sharp psychological dread. While the writing stumbles and fails to deliver a tighter punch, Dakota's magnetic performance and the atmospheric mystery keep it thoroughly enjoyable.","created_at":"2026-10-04T03:24:45Z","id":"6ac1c6fdac9d8f608c01840c","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:41:13Z","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/review/6ac1c6fdac9d8f608c01840c"}],"total_pages":1,"total_results":5}}
